flowchart TD
    START([Start
    Locator: macAddress OR deviceIp+port
    Change set: description, adminStatus, VLANs]) --> A

    A{Step 1 -<br/>Locator path?}
    A -->|macAddress| Amac["Use client tracking
    -> resolve mgmtIp + clientPort
    -> accessSwitch UUID"]
    A -->|deviceIp + port| Aip["Direct addressing
    -> resolve switchUuid + port"]

    Amac --> B
    Aip --> B

    B["Step 2 - Get Interface Detail
    GET /dna/intent/api/v1/interface/network-device/{deviceUuid}"] --> C

    C["Step 3 - Extract Port UUID
    JSONPath: filter by portName
    -> interfaceUuid"] --> D

    D["Step 4 - Set Variables
    apply change set into apiBody payloads"] --> E

    E{Step 5 - Condition Operation Block}
    E -->|description supplied| Edesc["POST /dna/intent/api/v1/interface/{interfaceUuid}
    description payload"]
    E -->|adminStatus supplied| Eadmin["POST /dna/intent/api/v1/interface/{interfaceUuid}
    admin Up/Down/Reset payload"]
    E -->|dataVlan/voiceVlan supplied| Evlan["POST /dna/intent/api/v1/interface/{interfaceUuid}
    VLAN reassignment payload"]

    Edesc --> END
    Eadmin --> END
    Evlan --> END
    E -->|no change selected| END([End])
